<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang='en-US'><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><script>window['ec:pageId']='6871500385119532663'</script><title>CFP</title><link href="/images/favicon.ico" rel="icon" type="image/jpeg"/><link href="/css/cool.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/cfp/classic.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/menu_cfp.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<script src="/js/easy.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/menu.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/form.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/inplace.js?version=545"></script><script>EC.version='545'</script></head>
<body><table class="page" id="page"><tr style="height:1px"><td><table class="header"><tr><td class="logocell"><a href="/" title="EasyChair home page"><img class="leftlogo" src="/images/logoEC_short.png"/></a></td><td class="rolecell">EasyChair Smart CFP</td><td style="width: 99%"></td><td class="helplink"><a class="toplinks" href="/docs/home" title="User guide">User guide</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr style="height:99%"><td class="menu_and_content"><div class="menu" id="menu0"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="menu" style="position:static; visibility:visible"><tr><td class="top" id="menu1" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu1','/cfp',{&quot;a&quot;:null})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu1')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu1')" title="Main page">Home</td><td class="top" id="menu2" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu2','/cfp/choose',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu2')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu2')" title="Create a new CFP">New CFP</td><td class="top" id="menu3" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu3','/cfp/all',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu3')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu3')" title="Manage my CFPs">My CFPs</td><td class="top" id="menu4" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu4','/cfp/watchlist',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu4')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu4')" title="My CFP watchlist">Watchlist</td></tr></table></div><div class="search_row" id="cfp:search:row"><form action="/cfp/search" id="search-form"><input id="search-input" name="query" placeholder="Search" type="text"/></form></div><div class="summary"><div class="pagetitle">CFP</div></div><div class="content" id="content"><div class="subcontent"><div id="cfp" style="clear:right"><table class="title_table"><tr><td class="single"><div id="cfptitle">ICCCS2027: 2027 12th International Conference on Computer and Communication Systems</div><div id="cfpvenue">Shenzhen University Conference Center</div><div id="cfpdateplace">Shenzhen, China, April 16-19, 2027</div></td></tr></table><table class="date_table"><tr><td>Conference web page</td><td><a href="https://www.icccs.org/" target="_blank">https://www.icccs.org/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission link</td><td><a href="https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icccs2027" target="_blank">https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icccs2027</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission deadline</td><td>November 25, 2026</td></tr></table><div class="topics">Topics: <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=55895" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_darkred bg_yellow">computer architecture</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=747" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_darkred bg_darkyellow">algorithms</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=718515" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_navy bg_haki">communication theory</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=3953" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_black bg_darkyellow">virtual reality</span></a></div><p><span style="font-size:14px">2027 12th International Conference on Computer and Communication Systems (ICCCS) will be held in Shenzhen University, Shenzhen, China on April 16-19, 2027, which is sponsored by Shenzhen University, China.</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">ICCCS (IEEE) is an international conference dedicated to advances in Computer and Communication Systems. Since its inception in 2015 · Kanyakumari, India, ICCCS has served as a platform for researchers and practitioners worldwide.</span></p><h2>Submission Guidelines</h2><p><strong><span style="font-size:14px">Language</span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">English is the official language of the conference; the paper should be written and presented only in English.</span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:14px">Paper Length Limit</span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">Each paper should be more than 4 full pages normally,including all figures, tables, and references.</span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:14px">Extra Pages</span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">The first 6 pages are free of extra fee, extra pages will be charged at $60 (US dollars/per page) when the paper exceeds 6 pages.</span></p><h2>List of Topics</h2><p><span style="font-size:14px">• Software Engineering and Knowledge Engineering</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">• Computer Architecture</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">• Database</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">• Distributed Storage</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">• Big Data, Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">• Algorithms</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">• Image and Video Processing</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">• Mobile Computing, Trusted Computing, Intelligent Computing</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">• Parallel and Distributing Computing</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">• Biomedical Informatics and Computation</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">• Virtual Reality and Visualization</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">• Network Security and Cryptography</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">• ...</span></p><h2>Committees</h2><p><span style="font-size:14px">Conference Chairs</span></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Yejun He, Shenzhen University, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Ning Xu, Wuhan University of Technology, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Qingchun Chen, Guangzhou University, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Yisheng An, Chang'an University, China</span></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:14px">Program Chairs</span></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Pingyi Fan, Tsinghua University, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Pei Xiao, University of Surrey, UK</span></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:14px">Program Co-Chairs</span></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Xiaojun Yuan, University of Electronic Science and Technology of China, China, IEEE Fellow</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Qinghe Du, Xi'an Jiaotong University, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Minquan Cheng, Guangxi Normal University, China</span></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:14px">Program Committee</span></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Yongwei Huang, Guangdong University of Technology, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Lin Lin, Tongji University, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Long Luo, University of Electronic Science and Technology of China, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Jinbao Zhu, Hong Kong University of Science and Technology (Guangzhou), China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Lisu Yu, Nanchang University, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Pei Liu, Wuhan University of Technology, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Yangzhe Liao, Wuhan University of Technology, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Qibiao Zhu, Nanchang University, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Youlong Wu, ShanghaiTech University, China</span></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:14px">Track Chairs</span></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Huaqun Guo, Singapore Institute of Technology, Singapore</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Nour El Madhoun, ISEP, France</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Eyasu Getahun Chekole, Singapore University of Technology and Design, Singapore</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Ezhilmathi Krishnasamy, University of Luxembourg, Luxembourg; University of Ljubljana, Slovenia</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Guillaume Helbecque, University of Lille, France</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Anand Bhojan, National University of Singapore, Singapore</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Yulia Cherdantseva, Cardiff University, United Kingdom</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Noori Kim, Purdue University, United States</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Jiqiang Lu, Beihang University, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Maode Ma, Shenzhen University of Advanced Technology, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Zhiyuan Zhang, Singapore Management University, Singapore</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Yongqing Zhu, Singapore University of Social Sciences, Singapore</span></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:14px">Student Program Chairs</span></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Jianbiao Zhang, Beijing University of Technology, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Juan Fang, Beijing University of Technology</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Chenglin Li, Shanghai Jiaotong University, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Ang Gao, Northwestern Polytechnical University, China</span></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:14px">Academic Committee</span></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Yuan Zhuang, Wuhan University, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Jianguo Chen, Sun Yat-sen University, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Qiang Li, Jinan University, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Xiaojun Mei, Shanghai Maritime University, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Jiawei Zhu, Chang'an University, China</span></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:14px">Publication Chairs</span></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Yunyun Bi, Wuhan University, China</span></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:14px">Treasurer</span></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Huanyong Cao, China University of Geosciences, China</span></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:14px">Regional Chairs</span></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Alvin Jason A. Virata, Technological Institute of the Philippines, Philippines</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Qiyue Yin, Institute of Automation, Chinese Academy of Sciences, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Luping Zhang, Shandong Institute of Space Electronic Technology, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Noli Mark A. Paala, John Paul College, Philippines</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Xuebo Zhang, Northwest Normal University, China</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Shuai Wang, Shenzhen Institutes of Advanced Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences, China</span></li></ul><h2>Invited Speakers</h2><ul><li><span style="font-size:14px">Speaker 1 Prof. Mingbo Niu, Chang’an University, China</span></li><li><span style="font-size:14px">Speaker 2 Prof. Fan Liu, Southeast University, China</span></li><li><span style="font-size:14px">Speaker 3 Assoc. Prof. Limeng Dong, Northwestern Polytechnical University, China</span></li><li><span style="font-size:14px">Speaker 4 Assoc. Prof. Bingpeng Zhou, Sun Yat-sen University, China</span></li><li><span style="font-size:14px">Speaker 5 Asst. Prof. Shuai Wang, University of Electronic Science and Technology of China</span></li></ul><h2>Publication</h2><p><span style="font-size:14px">After careful reviewing process, all accepted papers after proper registration and presentation, will be published by Conference Proceedings, included in Digital Xplore.</span></p><h2>Venue</h2><p><span style="font-size:14px">Shenzhen University Conference Center</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">Address: Shenzhen University (Nanshan Campus), No. 3688 Nanhai Avenue, Nanshan District, Shenzhen, Guangdong, China</span></p><h2>Contact</h2><p><span style="font-size:14px">Conference secretary: Lily Chen</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">Email: <a href="mailto:icccs_contact@vip.163.com" target="_blank">icccs_contact@vip.163.com</a></span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">Tel: 86-132-9869-9999</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">The conference secretary will reply you within 2 workdays.</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px">Office hours: Monday to Friday | 9:30-18:00</span></p></div></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class="footer">Copyright © 2002 – 2026 EasyChair</td></tr></table></body></html>
